---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of service | European Scrap Market"
  description="Terms of service for European Scrap Market."
>

<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-12 sm:px-8">
  <p class="mono" data-reveal>LEGAL</p>
  <h1 class="display h-section mt-3" data-reveal>Terms of <span class="grad-text">service</span></h1>

  <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-muted)]" data-reveal>
    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">1. The service</h2>
    <p>European Scrap Market is a marketplace connecting sellers of metal scrap with verified scrap yards across Europe. Submitting a request is free for sellers.</p>

    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">2. No obligation</h2>
    <p>Sellers are not obligated to sell to the yard that contacts them. Yards are not obligated to accept any given case. European Scrap Market is not a party to any transaction between sellers and yards.</p>

    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">3. Verification</h2>
    <p>European Scrap Market verifies yards before they can accept requests, but does not guarantee the conduct or solvency of any individual yard or seller.</p>

    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">4. Liability</h2>
    <p>European Scrap Market is not liable for transactions between sellers and yards. Disputes should be resolved between the parties.</p>

    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">5. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms. Continued use of the service constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 rounded-lg border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-amber-800" data-reveal>
    <strong>Placeholder:</strong> These are draft terms. Final legal terms should be reviewed by a qualified lawyer before going live.
  </div>
</div>

</Layout>
